wrote in about three weeks three to four weeks

00:04:09.799 --> 00:04:15.069
maybe no not even four weeks I think it was
like three weeks three weeks yeah I had it

00:04:15.069 --> 00:04:20.280
I had it pretty much locked in but again that
was the first draft and that's the other thing

00:04:20.280 --> 00:04:29.770
it's you know writing is rewriting is rewriting
is rewriting so you know what I always enjoy

00:04:29.770 --> 00:04:36.390
actually and I should you know back this up
is that putting the script down is that putting

00:04:36.390 --> 00:04:45.760
